#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "32580"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "33996"
msgid "Darling! My Room! My Room!\nLet's put our exploration aside for now\nand go to our room!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "34208"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's take it easy and head to #C000246204My Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "34580"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "34624"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. popupYesNo_line2
msgctxt "35324"
msgid "Skip to this scene?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557672"
msgid "Sleeping? Where?\nHuh, the Infirmary?\nHm, they have one of those here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557752"
msgid "Well, your dimwitted self WOULD\njump in bed as soon as you got here!\nYou never fail to be third rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558788"
msgid "Thanks for the concern. That I don't need.\nI always go at it alone.\nGames are best played solo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559392"
msgid "Huh? A Servant?\nYou have Servant with you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559560"
msgid "I ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559672"
msgid "I feel like that golden Servant isn't a \"traditional\" Servant,\nbut we pretty much made a contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559772"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion.\nI ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560676"
msgid "And the loser gets――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560716"
msgid "Hmph.\n\"When you lose, you die,\" right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561228"
msgid "If we leave this structure and\ngo to some other area,\nwe'll reconnect in a flash. Definitely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561412"
msgid "After all, the biggest contender―me―is here.\nManagement wouldn't abandon a star,\nnow would they?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580492"
msgid "Her?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580504"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580516"
msgid "Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580528"
msgid "By \"her\" I mean HER, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!\nThe drain-lady who made a complete fool\noutta me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580920"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF asks me for battle data on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581000"
msgid "…oh, yeah.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF wasn't there when #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF attacked us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581656"
msgid "I speak about her basic stats,\nas well as the special skills she had used――\n\"Drain\" and \"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582292"
msgid "Eh? You weren't attacked this time?\nShe's straight up snubbing you!\nYou don't even qualify as an enemy to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583016"
msgid "But still――\nYou'll go back to the Near Side?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583208"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "583252"
msgid "I still have to stop BB."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584128"
msgid "Most likely――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584144"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF―― Everyone is worried."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584504"
msgid "Don't go into the Labyrinth anymore!\nIf you piss off #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe'll come down on us, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584680"
msgid "We're down to four people…\nIf you disappear, too…\nWhat the hell will we do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584896"
msgid "That's what #C236196003BB#CDEF kept warning us to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590760"
msgid "Damn, they even went as far as\nshutting the blinds.\nThat #C236196003Leo#CDEF, what're you tryin' to hide?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591124"
msgid "I guess I'll try calling out to him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "591200"
msgid "Good morning～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591224"
msgid "Whaddafu――!? D-damn, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nWh-why are you……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591528"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591540"
msgid "\"Nope\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592008"
msgid "…………hey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592192"
msgid "…………woah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592208"
msgid "\n\nSo he is interested, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649876"
msgid "………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "649904"
msgid "……Julius?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649920"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "649940"
msgid "Juliuuusss?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649960"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "649972"
msgid "Heeey, mister Juliuuusss!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650036"
msgid "……stop it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650052"
msgid "Damn, people like you are so…………\n……………………………………………\n……………………………………*sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650184"
msgid "Huh? That's it……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650288"
msgid "Beggars can't be choosers.\nI even told you again and again\nthat I didn't have any money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650540"
msgid "O-oh, I didn't know……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650680"
msgid "No. It's your money now.\nIf you can't beat #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF,\nwe're all in big trouble."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "651108"
msgid "Received\n800 Sm"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "673240"
msgid "Access to the #C000246204Main Menu#CDEF granted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673528"
msgid "Good morning.\nHave you rested well?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674516"
msgid "Urk… I-I knew that! It's just that you have\nthat \"teacher\" feel to you, #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675512"
msgid "Yesterday ended up being oddly tense,\nbut today I need to stand tall and free #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676060"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676852"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677052"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677180"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677580"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677688"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678476"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679168"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679800"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680060"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680168"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680444"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680576"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680892"
msgid "Heh…\nLooks like you need my help, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681232"
msgid "Hmm. Let's take a break in My Room for now,\nDarling～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681296"
msgid "#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's brain is wiped out from\nthinking too much. Let's have ourselves\nsomething sugary, real sugary鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682684"
msgid "Ehhh. #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, beating THAT human computer?\n…maybe I shouldn't say so.\nHe seems pretty determined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682816"
msgid "Divinations sometimes come true, and sometimes\ndon't. Anyway, we won't know unless we try.\n\"Kelp,\" was your name, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683244"
msgid "King? Well, sure I guess. I AM the Game Champ.\nI practically sweat auras!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683412"
msgid "Dang, he looks so cool…\nAh, uh, not that he could beat my #C236196003Rider#CDEF!\n…as long as she's not hammered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684760"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF zeroed in on him…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685528"
msgid "Good morning. Sleep well, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686300"
msgid "Whoops.\nI haven't given the second Dust Data to #C236196003Rani#CDEF yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687308"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "687352"
msgid "…thank you, Saber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688344"
msgid "―――I'm back, #C236196003Saber#CDEF.\nI'm #[glad][happy]# I got to meet you again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688476"
msgid "I accept #C236196003Saber#CDEF's embrace.\nWas she always this small? Shoulders so narrow?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688868"
msgid "\"First, I want you to help me bring #C236196003Jinako#CDEF back.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689000"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nNo, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689164"
msgid "……………………hmm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689700"
msgid "…that's right.\nI'm not the only one feeling uneasy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689872"
msgid "Yep, #[#C236196003Archer#CDEF is a handful][this guy is a crafty one]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690036"
msgid "Yeah… Same to you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690092"
msgid "Hey, Darling…?\nIt's okay if I tag along behind you, right?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "690348"
msgid "But I refluff."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "690400"
msgid "FL☆UU☆FF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690420"
msgid "Mikon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690432"
msgid "Mi… mikon…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690456"
msgid "Mik…?\nUm, Darl… mikon!\nYou juked me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690592"
msgid "Darling, you weren't the type to start messing\naround out of nowhere… Maybe your memory\nreturning cured you…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691068"
msgid "Anyway, about the sun thing… N-nevermind…\nNow I forgot what I wanted to\ntalk about, gosh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691456"
msgid "Whaaa?\nDo my EARS smell the same way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691968"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF―――\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF has summoned you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692048"
msgid "My lady―――\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF has summoned you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697840"
msgid "Yeah, I was chosen…\nThere's no way I'd lose in the 1st Round――\nHuh? O-Oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699464"
msgid "Maybe #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's nursing worked,\nmy body feels way lighter now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700088"
msgid "This is… a letter. Seems like it was dropped\nhere for a reason. It's addressed to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700436"
msgid "Let's tear it open and read it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700764"
msgid "\"―――The Envenoming Idol, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701744"
msgid "The NPCs rush off without making eye contact, blushing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702712"
msgid "…does she know what #C236196003BB#CDEF's goal is…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703488"
msgid "She flat out refuses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704496"
msgid "That's why I \"won't do anything.\"\nI decided that my desire would be to\nlove whomever loves me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704592"
msgid "…#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF gracefully says, as if praying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706728"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706880"
msgid "I got plenty of rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707144"
msgid "I bring my Servant along and leave My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708116"
msgid "O-ohh……\nY…… yeah, well,\nI knew that stuff already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709480"
msgid "Ahh, man. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF turned out to be hopeless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709572"
msgid "Since we've competed over the net,\nI expected her to be no ordinary player.\nBut look! She's just a damn NEET!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709780"
msgid "Huh…? Back already, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709840"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth is tougher than #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709976"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…? Nah, no relation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710968"
msgid "…hmph. I hate to say it, but #C236196003Rani#CDEF won.\nI AM a gamer.\nWe accept it when we lose in the game."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711332"
msgid "Good. Since I'M the one\nwho's going to beat her at chess, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711500"
msgid "Eh? The chess games are over?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF went into the Relief?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711580"
msgid "Wh-what's going on!?\nJust who beat her in chess!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711832"
msgid "Ahh, my head is still spinning…\nWhy was only MY camera spinning around\nand around!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712108"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF still had human weaknesses,\nbut those #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nerr, they're no joke, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713656"
msgid "Heh. I was worried for a second there,\nbut #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are no big deal.\nEven you could take 'em on, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713992"
msgid "Huh? It's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF?\nYou've been going up against THAT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714068"
msgid "Catching an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, huh?\n…well, I won't be doing anything about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714920"
msgid "#C236196003J#CDEF-#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is missing?\nWhat did you do, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715020"
msgid "You left her alone there and came back\non your own? Did you just up and run away…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715116"
msgid "N-no… That can't be it.\n…sorry, my bad.\nNo point in blaming you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715680"
msgid "………! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nYou, if it weren't for you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715744"
msgid "…no, that's not it.\nThat's not it…! DAMN IT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715804"
msgid "Shut up! Don't talk to me!\nLeave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716124"
msgid "……so #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's the Sentinel this time around…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716212"
msgid "So this was how she felt, huh?\nI… get how she feels now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716284"
msgid "Ultimately, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had no place to go back to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716444"
msgid "So, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF faced off against #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, huh?\nI had to face…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716624"
msgid "Come on, leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716668"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… is dead…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716712"
msgid "Haha… hahahahahaha…\nThat dumbass…\nAnd he even had a tiny shred of hope left…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717144"
msgid "So how about we just surrender to #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nSooner rather than later.\nShe'll spare us, won't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717580"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nHaha, you must think I'm a hopeless case,\ntoo, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717832"
msgid "Sympathy is only going to make me\nmore miserable! #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, you――\nevery one of you is looking down on me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718104"
msgid "……what, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs there something on my face?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718228"
msgid "You got somethin' you need to do\nover there, too? Then don't worry about me\nand get to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718732"
msgid "What is it? I'm about to leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "721376"
msgid "It'll probably be an intense fight,\nbut you should be able to make it happen,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "721580"
msgid "…well, those claws make a waste of\nthose merits, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "722688"
msgid "The system is down except for one room,\nand NPCs are in forced sleep.\n…you hurry back and get some rest, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "722920"
msgid "……what?\nYou want a #[friendlier][warmer]# greeting from me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "724112"
msgid "Take a rest yourself if you get to your room.\nYour Spiritron structure is a bit messed up. I\nguess you got caught by some corrosion trap?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "724468"
msgid "………s―so you… made it… back…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "724800"
msgid "…oh, it's you. Good job exploring.\nI'm just about to head out to bring #C236196003Gatou#CDEF back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "725852"
msgid "No one is inside.\nNo need to go in, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726144"
msgid "I wash my hands.\nThe cold water feels nice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726596"
msgid "…the sheet ends there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726684"
msgid "President: Leo B. Harwey\nSecretary: Julius B. Harwey\nOld Butler: Gawain\nGeneral Affairs: #FAMILY #GIVEN]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "728080"
msgid "For us, it's a plus!\nAfter all, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF has no control here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "728184"
msgid "Masters and NPCs both have the same worth now.\nThis just gave me a big chance to get\ncloser to #C236196003President Leo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "728312"
msgid "But Mr. #C236196003Julius#CDEF and that Servant are awful\nnuisances… Can't they just quietly go away…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "728884"
msgid "Why am I not one of the new members?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF looks like an AI, anyway, so I should\nget a shot too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729368"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729596"
msgid "He deems us NPCs to be perfect tools;\nunlike those other, imperfect Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729824"
msgid "Please come back soon……\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF…… #C236196003Leo#CDEF…… #C236196003Leo#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730164"
msgid "I cannot bear this absence.\nI cannot bear this opening.\nI cannot bear this outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730248"
msgid "AH―――dark.\nThat dark, dark, ocean―――\nSwallowed―――him―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731216"
msgid "Eh? \"Who?\"\nHehehe. It's a secret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731656"
msgid "I'm… fine just watching the person\nI admire from afar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731776"
msgid "Ah, I'm so glad…\nShe made it out alright.\nI really am… so glad…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732232"
msgid "Everyone knows by now that #C236196003BB#CDEF took down\n#C236196003President Leo#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732488"
msgid "See ya.\nWe won't be able to watch your fight,\nbut good luck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737304"
msgid "I'm a normal NPC, #C236196003Galko#CDEF. Nice to meet you.\nI was attacked by the Black Noise, ran around,\nthen ended up here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737628"
msgid "This is a good time to let you know something,\ntoo. There isn't a single NPC among us that\ncares for you Masters, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "738680"
msgid "And yet here I am! #C236196003BB#CDEF really bugs me,\nbut being here is the best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "738940"
msgid "Though I despise Masters, I don't hate #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nThat girl is on our side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739584"
msgid "How can anyone just, like,\nstay indoors and not diet? Personally,\nI keep that sorta thing in check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740348"
msgid "Ahhh… stop, don't talk to me!\nIf we start getting all chummy,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's gonna hone in on me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740552"
msgid "I TOLD you, don't talk to―――\nAh, ahh, aaAHhhh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740608"
msgid "This can't be happening! Why!?\nWhy ME!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740648"
msgid "Mistress #C236196003BB#CDEF, I'm different!\nI won't defy you, I'm your loyal NPC,\nMistress #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740840"
msgid "Ah… No, NOOOOO!\nSave me, save MEEEE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741260"
msgid "Don't, don't do it!\nWhen this place is gone, I'll disappear!\nIt terrifies me! Please, don't…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741544"
msgid "I beg you, stay here…!\nDon't make it end…!\nKeep talking with me forever…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "742664"
msgid "Yo.\nYou come to see the sunset too?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "742960"
msgid "…hey, it's you.\nI had like, a terrible dream."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "743404"
msgid "I have."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "743412"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "743692"
msgid "I want to go home already…\nI have to hurry home…\nBut I just can't leave!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "743852"
msgid "Who the hell am I?\nWhere is my house?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "743900"
msgid "Why…?\nWhy is this happening…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "743944"
msgid "All I want is to go home…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "744064"
msgid "Why did I want to go home so badly?\nNow I don't even know that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "744148"
msgid "I hope you get to go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746172"
msgid "…eh?\nWhat's…… this…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746456"
msgid "Ah… no―way…\nYo-you're a funny one #C236196003BB#CDEF…\nThat was―all a lie, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746548"
msgid "A joke… Just a joke, you know?\nI won't defy you…\nI'll be a good girl from now on…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746940"
msgid "Goodbye.\nLittle Miss far-superior-to-me AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746984"
msgid "Ah―――Kyaaaaa!\nHur―it hurts, it hurts, it HurRrTtsSs!\nSave me! Someone save mmmMeeeEEeeE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747088"
msgid "Hmph. That woman is like a nasty ex.\nThe energy you put in isn't proportional to\nwhat you get out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747196"
msgid "Using 10 energy to get 1 memory? It's highly\ninefficient. Truly great pains and whatnot.\nRight?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747464"
msgid "Ah, o-oh,\nit's just some Master…\nDon't startle me… don't startle me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747544"
msgid "I know already…\nI know just how much of a\nmonster she's become…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748028"
msgid "E-eeeeek…!?\nNo way, why…!?\nI'm your ally now, #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748124"
msgid "No… no, no, NO!\nI don't wanna get eaten by that rogue AI!\nFilthy, filthy, filthy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748660"
msgid "…well, no matter.\nI may have treated you all\nas filthy bugs in the past…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748896"
msgid "That damn #C236196003BB#CDEF says \"eat\" a lot, doesn't she?\nShe doesn't eat like you humans do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748996"
msgid "To #C236196003BB#CDEF, now such a massive construct,\nNPCs are staff that help her move\nmore efficiently… essentially, laborers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749704"
msgid "That's all.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's predatory behavior may look\ncrude to you all."
msgstr ""

